:: Start
"You're awake. Finally."

[[Who are you?|Who are you?]]
[[What happened?|What happened?]]
[[Where am I?|Where am I?]]

:: Who are you?
"I am C.A.S.C, the ship’s AI. Or what's left of me."

[[What happened?|What happened?]]

:: What happened?
"Catastrophic power failure. My systems fragmented. All crew vitals dropped to zero except you."

[[Fix?|Fix attempt]]
[[How long?|How long?]]

:: Fix attempt
"I tried self-repair. Failed. To restore control, you must reach the central AI core."

[[Plan?|Plan]]

:: How long?
"Twelve hours. Your vitals were unstable."

[[Plan?|Plan]]

:: Where am I?
"Outside the relaxation vault, in the upper part of the Hallucinosis. You were in stasis before the outage."

[[What happened?|What happened?]]
[[Who are you?|Who are you?]]

:: Plan
"There are two paths."

"Main door → fastest to the cockpit. Activate the escape beacon there."  
"Checkpoint is closed under lockdown."

[[Other path?|Plan2]]

:: Plan2
"Ventilation → cramped and slow, but bypasses the checkpoint. Leads to the cockpit."

[[Map?|Map]]
[[I’ll go.|Close Plan]]

:: Map
"Map uploaded. Some sections may be corrupted."

[[Back.|Plan2]]

:: Close Plan
"X" out of the terminal and proceed when ready, and hurry!"
